# Run artifacts a render leaves in its sandbox: one rysh session per tape means
# every render writes history, reports and session state here. Regenerated on
# demand, never a deliverable.
render-sandbox*/.rysh/history/
render-sandbox*/.rysh/reports/
render-sandbox*/.rysh/sessions/
render-control.log
